      <p class="text-grey text-[16.5px] mt-3.5">We don't sell you a pre-packaged software suite. We analyze your specific daily headaches and build the exact bridge you need to stop doing manual administrative work.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 cards:grid-cols-3 gap-[22px]">
      <%= partial "partials/problem_fix_card", locals: {
        num: "FIX / 01",
        title: "Eliminating Manual Data Entry",
        problem: "Downloading resumes from email, copy-pasting contact details, uploading files into your database by hand.",
        fix: "An emailed resume finds and attaches itself to the right profile in Recruiterflow — no download, no click."
      } %>
      <%= partial "partials/problem_fix_card", locals: {
        num: "FIX / 02",
        title: "Automated Interview Summaries",
        problem: "Forty-five minutes after every screening call spent cleaning notes and writing a client-ready summary.",
        fix: "An AI pipeline takes the raw transcript and instantly produces a clean, submission-ready summary."
      } %>
      <%= partial "partials/problem_fix_card", locals: {
        num: "FIX / 03",
        title: "Escaping Clunky Software",
        problem: "Your ATS or CRM doesn't fit anymore, but you're afraid of losing your database if you switch.",
        fix: "An honest platform assessment, plus a fully handled technical migration of your data."
      } %>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-9">
      <a class="btn-primary" href="<%= config[:calendly_url] %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" data-sa-event="cta_click_midpage">Book a Free Discovery Call →</a>
